# packages/tala-mobile/.gitignore ignores every `android/` (the Expo prebuild output). This module's
# android/ holds SOURCE (Kotlin/Java, manifest, gradle) and must be tracked; a deeper .gitignore
# takes precedence, so re-include it here and re-exclude only generated things.
!android/
!android/**
android/build/
android/.gradle/
android/jvm/build/
android/jvm/.gradle/
# Generated at build time from the tala-0.4.x branch by scripts/sync-card-catalog.mjs (1.9 MB, append-only).
android/src/main/assets/card-catalog.tsv
android/src/main/assets/.card-catalog.blob
